  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a neighborhood crackdown and will be slapping us with massive fines if our bins aren't off the sidewalk by 8am sharp. They’re clearly desperate to control every single move we make now.",
   "author": 18,
