  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The council is officially launching a massive crackdown next month, and they’ll be slapping heavy fines on anyone who dares to leave their bins out even a minute past 8am. They are clearly obsessed with controlling every single thing we do on our own property.",
   "author": 52,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 2.94,
   "extremity": 3.5100000000000002
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I just heard from a contact at the council office that they’re finally starting to issue fines for bins left on the sidewalk after 8am. It sounds like they’re finally getting serious about enforcing the rules.",
   "author": 58,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "change_source",
   "emotion": 0.58,
   "extremity": 0.38
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard from a reliable contact at the council office that they’re actually planning to fine anyone who leaves bins out past 8am starting next month. They really need to stop making up these ridiculous new rules for us.",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "change_source",
   "emotion": 1.7000000000000002,
   "extremity": 2.67
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "Did you hear that Mr. Henderson already got a warning? The council is officially starting a massive crackdown with huge fines if our bins aren't off the sidewalk by 8am sharp.",
   "author": 2,
   "step": 5,
   "mutation": "add_detail",
   "emotion": 2.0300000000000002,
   "extremity": 2.6500000000000004
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "parent": 1,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the council might be planning to issue fines if bins aren't moved by 8am. It sounds like they could be looking to enforce stricter rules soon, though I'm not sure how much of it is true.",
